Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.90,0:00:14.63,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,繼承的意志……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:17.54,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,時代的浪潮、\N人們的夢想……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:20.37,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,這些都無法阻止。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:23.48,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,只要人們追求自由，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:26.11,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,這些事物就永遠不會消逝。
